\fs28 \cf0 Workflow 1: Incoming Customer Message\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs22 \cf4 \strokec4 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf5 \strokec5 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 1. WhatsApp \uc0\u8594  Webhook \u8594  Backend receives message\
2. Load conversation context (last 5 messages from DB)\
3. Check if escalated to human (if yes, notify owner, skip AI)\
4. Send to Google ADK Agent:\
   a. Intent classification (inquiry/order/complaint)\
   b. Trigger Google File Search if needed (product query)\
   c. Fetch relevant FAQs from DB\
5. Build prompt for Claude AI:\
   - Business context (tone, products)\
   - Search results (if any)\
   - Conversation history\
6. Claude generates response\
7. Confidence check:\
   - High (>0.85): Send response to customer\
   - Low (<0.85): Escalate + send holding message\
8. Log everything to DB\
9. Return response to WhatsApp API\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

