\f1\fs24 \cf5 \strokec5 \shad\shadx0\shady-20\shadr0\shado0 \shadc0 1. Owner uploads product CSV/images via Dashboard\
2. Backend processes:\
   - Parse and store in Product table\
   - Upload to Google Drive folder (for File Search)\
   - Trigger Google File Search API indexing\
3. Confirmation to owner\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

